//   1. Google token server: keeps the OAuth "client secret" off the phone/computer
//        POST /exchange { code }           -> { access_token, expires_in, refresh_token }
//        POST /refresh  { refresh_token }  -> { access_token, expires_in }
//   2. Lock-screen notifications (Web Push) even when Kairos is closed
